        <span class="gd-eyebrow" style="text-align:left">In short</span>
        <h2>An elderly move manager <em>explained</em></h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">An elderly move manager, also called a later-life move manager, is a professional who plans and coordinates a move for an older person. Instead of arranging a removals firm, a cleaner, an estate agent and a packing team separately, you work with one person who looks after the whole process.</p>
        <ul class="rx-points"><li><i class="fas fa-user-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>One coordinator</h3><p>One person plans and manages the whole move.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-box-open" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Practical, hands-on</h3><p>Sorting, packing, removal and settling in.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Works with your agents</h3><p>Alongside your estate agent and solicitor.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-ban" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Not advice</h3><p>No care, legal or financial advice, and not an estate agent.</p></li></ul>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="gd-sec grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">What they do</span><h2>What an elderly move manager <em>typically does</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="gd-steps">
      <li><span class="gd-num">1</span><p>Plans the move with you: where, when, what will fit and what it will cost.</p></li>
      <li><span class="gd-num">2</span><p>Helps sort and declutter at your pace, with decisions staying with you.</p></li>
      <li><span class="gd-num">3</span><p>Arranges or carries out packing, and books a fully insured removal.</p></li>
      <li><span class="gd-num">4</span><p>Works alongside your estate agent and solicitor so dates and paperwork line up.</p></li>
      <li><span class="gd-num">5</span><p>Arranges cleaning, utilities and storage where needed.</p></li>
      <li><span class="gd-num">6</span><p>Unpacks, sets up the new home and checks you are settled.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Comparison</span><h2>How it differs from <em>other services</em></h2></div>
    <div class="gd-compare">
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Removals company</h3><p>A removals company moves belongings on the day. See <a href="/about-chayce/">Chayce compared with a standard removals company</a>.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Estate agent</h3><p>An estate agent sells or lets property. An elderly move manager does not sell property.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>House-clearance firm</h3><p>A house-clearance firm empties a property. An elderly move manager helps you decide what to keep, sell, donate or let go, and nothing goes without your agreement.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Financial or legal adviser</h3><p>A financial or legal adviser gives regulated advice. An elderly move manager does not.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rx-band" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-hero2.jpg" %});{% imageSet "chayce-hero2.jpg" %}">
  <div class="container"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Always your decision</span><h2>Nothing goes <em font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light)>without your agreement.</em></h2><p>An elderly move manager helps you decide what to keep, sell, donate or let go. The role is practical, not medical, legal or financial.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-split">
      <div>
        <span class="gd-eyebrow">When it helps</span>
        <h2>When an elderly move manager is <em>worth considering</em></h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="gd-list ticks">
        <li>You are leaving a family home you have lived in for many years.</li>
        <li>You live far from family, or you are arranging a parent's move from a distance.</li>
        <li>The sale or purchase has tight dates and the packing cannot wait.</li>
        <li>You are moving to a bungalow, retirement apartment or <a href="/retirement-village-removals/">retirement village</a> with limited space.</li>
        <li>You want one person to deal with instead of several companies.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-split">
      <div>
        <span class="gd-eyebrow">Choosing one</span>
        <h2>Questions to ask <em>before you choose</em></h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="gd-list qs">
        <li>Is the removal insured, and is the cover set out in writing?</li>
        <li>Is the quote fixed before the move begins?</li>
        <li>Is the team employed and vetted by the company, or subcontracted?</li>
        <li>Will I have one named contact throughout?</li>
        <li>Can I see a clear price list? Ours is on the <a href="/packages/">packages page</a>.</li>
        <li>Will I stay in control of every decision about my belongings?</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

